    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ibyo ku ngoma ya Hezekiya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekiya yatangiye gutegeka amaze imyaka makumyabiri n'itanu avutse, amara imyaka makumyabiri n'icyenda i Yerusalemu ari ku ngoma. Kandi nyina yitwaga Abiya, umukobwa wa Zekariya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akora ibishimwa n'Uwiteka, nk'ibyo sekuruza Dawidi yakoraga byose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka wa mbere wo ku ngoma ye, mu kwezi kwa mbere, akingura inzugi z'inzu y'Uwiteka, arazisana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yinjiza abatambyi n'Abalewi, abateraniriza ahantu hagari herekeye iburasirazuba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "arababwira ati “Nimunyumve mwa Balewi mwe, mwiyeze nonaha mweze n'inzu y'Uwiteka Imana ya ba sogokuruza banyu, mukure imyanda Ahantu hera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba data bacumuraga bagakora ibyangwa n'Uwiteka Imana yacu, bakayimūra bagahindukira bagakura amaso ku buturo bw'Uwiteka, bakabutera umugongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi bakinze inzugi z'ibaraza, bazimya amatabaza kandi ntibosereza Imana ya Isirayeli imibavu, cyangwa kuyitambira ibitambo byoswa Ahantu hera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni cyo cyatumye uburakari bw'Uwiteka buba ku Bayuda n'ab'i Yerusalemu, akabahāna ngo bateraganwe hirya no hino, bakaba ibishungero byimyozwa nk'uko namwe mubirebesha amaso yanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dore ibyo byateye ko ba data bicwa n'inkota, kandi abahungu bacu n'abakobwa bacu n'abagore bacu baba abanyagano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“None ngambiriye gusezerana isezerano n'Uwiteka Imana ya Isirayeli, kugira ngo uburakari bwayo bw'inkazi butuveho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None bana banjye, mwe gutenguha kuko Uwiteka yabatoreye kumuhagarara imbere mukamukorera, mukaba abahereza be, mukosa imibavu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Abalewi barahaguruka, ari bo Mahati mwene Amasayi, na Yoweli mwene Azariya bo muri bene Kohati, n'abo muri bene Merari ari bo Kishi mwene Abudi na Azariya mwene Yehalelēli, n'abo muri bene Gerishoni ari bo Yowa mwene Zima na Edeni mwene Yowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'abo muri bene Elisafaniari ari bo Shimuri na Yeweli, n'abo muri bene Asafuari ari bo Zekariya na Mataniya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'abo muri bene Hemani ari bo Yehweli na Shimeyi, n'abo muri bene Yedutuni ari bo Shemaya na Uziyeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bateranya bene wabo bariyeza, barinjira ngo batunganye inzu y'Uwiteka nk'uko itegeko ry'umwami ryategetse, rikurikije ijambo ry'Uwiteka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko abatambyi bajya mu mwinjiro w'inzu y'Uwiteka kuwutunganya, basohora imyanda yose babonye mu rusengero rw'Uwiteka, bayigeza mu rugo rw'inzu y'Uwiteka. Abalewi baherako barayenda bayijyana ku gasozi, bayigeza ku kagezi kitwa Kidironi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi bahera ku munsi wa mbere w'ukwezi kwa mbere batangira kweza, ku munsi wa munani w'uko kwezi bagera ku ibaraza ry'Uwiteka, maze bereza inzu y'Uwiteka indi minsi munani, nuko ku munsi wa cumi n'itandatu w'ukwezi kwa mbere bararangiza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma bajya i bwami, basanga Umwami Hezekiya muri kambere ye baramubwira bati “Tumaze gutunganya inzu y'Uwiteka yose, n'icyotero cy'ibitambo byoswa n'ibintu byacyo byose, n'ameza imitsima yo kumurikwa iterekwaho imbere y'Uwiteka n'ibintu byayo byose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi n'ibintu byose Umwami Ahazi yataye ubwo yacumuraga ari ku ngoma, twabitunganije turabyeza, none biri imbere y'icyotero cy'Uwiteka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Umwami asubizaho imihango yo mu rusengero yari yaravuyeho",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye Umwami Hezekiya azinduka kare ateranya abatware b'umurwa, arazamuka ajya mu nzu y'Uwiteka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bazana amapfizi arindwi n'amasekurume y'intama arindwi, n'abana b'intama barindwi n'amasekurume y'ihene arindwi, ngo bibe igitambo gitambirwa ibyaha by'ubwami, n'iby'ubuturo bwera n'iby'Abayuda. Ategeka abatambyi bene Aroni kubitambira ku cyotero cy'Uwiteka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko ayo mapfizi barayabīkīra, abatambyi batega amaraso bayamisha ku cyotero, babīkīra amasekurume y'intama bamisha amaraso yayo ku cyotero, babīkīra n'abana b'intama bamisha amaraso yabo ku cyotero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze bigiza hafi amasekurume y'ihene imbere y'umwami n'iteraniro, bayarambikaho ibiganza ngo azabe igitambo gitambirwa ibyaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abatambyi barayabīkīra, batambira amaraso yayo ku cyotero bayatambirira icyaha ngo bahongerere Abisirayeli bose, kuko umwami yategetse ko batamba igitambo cyoswa, n'igitambo gitambirwa icyaha ngo bitambirwe Abisirayeli bose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
